--[[
    REEFERZ MM2 PREMIUM HUB
    Expanded / polished edition
    Pink + black theme
    Safe utility features from the supplied Vision Hub source.

    Not included:
    - AutoKill / KillAura
    - SilentThrow
    - AutoShootMurderer
    - SkidFling
    These directly automate attacking or disrupting other players.
]]

